          "id": 1588,
          "title": "Collecting Client Information Quickly",
          "description": "When someone wants to open an account, apply for a loan, or request financial advice, you need their details fast. \n\nInstead of handing out paper forms or asking for documents over email, Formester lets you collect everything in one smooth online flow.\n\nIt makes the process easier for clients and saves your team hours of manual work.\n\n**[View Full Use Case->](/use-case/client-onboarding/)**",
